# Atop the Highest Mountains (jeuno 129), each finish once its section no longer holds (a GM's change while the event
# is open): a level 51 Warrior at cap 55; 82 open, then cap 56: 82 answered 1: nothing (not begun); cap 55 again: 82,
# answered 1: begun. Accepted, the three frigicites (a GM): 84 open, then the quest set back to available (84's finish is
# the accepted section's): nothing (not completed, the frigicites kept, cap 55).
lists RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/82 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/84
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=WAR lvl=51
levelcap 55
login
trigger Maat                            # 82
levelcap 56                             # a GM, 82 open
finish option=1                         # cap 56: no section: nothing (not begun)
levelcap 55                             # a GM
trigger Maat                            # 82
finish option=1                         # begun
keyitem RoundFrigicite                  # a GM
keyitem SquareFrigicite
keyitem TriangularFrigicite
trigger Maat                            # 84
quest Jeuno.AtopTheHighestMountains available  # a GM, 84 open
finish                                  # available: 84's finish is the accepted section's: nothing
